{"ID":"20240220132606-ciaiylz","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132606-ciaiylz","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132606-ciaiylz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171158-y02qnit\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171158-crd6db9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:315,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171158-crd6db9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:33,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:33\u0026#125;","title":"【麻黄附子细辛汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171158-y02qnit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-y02qnit","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百一十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-p50czco","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-p50czco","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「少阴病」，始得之，反发热，脉沉者，「麻黄附子细辛汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-2hisek7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-2hisek7","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄附子细辛汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-eukzioy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-eukzioy","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄二两去筛。细辛二两。附子一枚，炮，去皮，破八片。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-459i60u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-459i60u","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水一升，先煮麻黄，减二升，去上沫，纳诸药，煮取三升，去滓，温服一升，日三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-3spb68c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-3spb68c","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处方比例：麻黄二钱。细辛二钱。炮附子三钱。麻黄附子细辛汤最主要是利小便。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-cwc228w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-cwc228w","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当心肾中焦是寒湿的时候。炮附子如果跟细辛在一起。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛能去积水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，下焦积水，在肠子里的积水。细辛去积水跟茯苓不一样，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"茯苓泽泻猪苓这些只是利水"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"细辛性比较热，所以能把寒水化掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。细辛还有一个功能，细辛在寒咳的时候，也会用到细辛，所以细辛这个药非常好用，最主要是它能去水。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-qb7ts8w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-qb7ts8w","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄能发阳，把阳气发起来，所以说他也是能够利水的一个药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。所以说如果把"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄附子细辛放在一起的时候，这个药不会走表，也不会发汗，它会跑到身体的正中间去"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为它是阳的重用的部位，少阴症本来就是里阳不足，里面是寒湿阳往外走。这个时候开麻黄细辛附子可以把里面的寒湿去掉。炮附子，是有固阳的功能。这三个药吃下去是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小便解，不是得汗解"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，次数会很多，量会很大。吃到脉浮起来，吃到小便正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-wef8725","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-wef8725","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 麻黄附子细辛汤是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"但欲寐，脉沉细，主力的方子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。它能够把中焦的寒湿都能够去掉。如果是关节上的寒湿这个没有用，会用炮附子去寒，桂枝祛风，白术来去湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-2z7l3zp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-2z7l3zp","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄附子细辛汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-knst77v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-knst77v","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄二。细辛二。附子三。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-0fkeelm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-0fkeelm","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方用的时候是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。麻黄附子细辛汤是寒湿在中膈。大黄附子细辛汤是寒实在大肠。大肠没有蠕动，便秘，没有屁，七八天不便秘也不难过。如果是阳明燥矢，承气汤症的时候，他便秘一定很痛，很难过，肚子会绞痛。完全没有感觉痛，小便淡白，这个时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小便淡白代表病在少阴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。大黄附子细辛汤方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大黄能够去实，附子能够去寒，细辛能够去中间湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。药吃到小便颜色变成淡黄，手脚温热起来，就可以停掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171158-crd6db9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171158-crd6db9","updated":"20240312171158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"攻下的处方遇到寒实的时候会用到大黄附子细辛汤，热实才会使用承气汤。"}]}]}